<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0C9A06009" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Rear Door Assembly Removal and Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0C9A06008">Rear Door Components</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Removal and installation procedures for rear door assembly basically the same as 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0C9A06007">Front Door Assembly Removal and Installation</intxref>
. However, note the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Removal and installation center pillar trims. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9806015"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Removal and installation rear door trim. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9506013"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
When door open stopper (1) is installed, face proper matching mark (2) upward.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Right side rear door: Mark “RR” faces upward
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Left side rear door: Mark “RL” faces upward
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten door open stopper bolt to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T9J004">
<t-part>
Door open stopper bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
21
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
2.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
15.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9A0013.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "71.083mm" ver = "01" gw = "193" gh = "185"/>
</figure>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten bolts and nuts to specified torques. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9A06008"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
